{"id":"vod_hh_56010","vodId":"56010","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"灵异E接触","name_cn":"灵异E接触","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第13集","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/a438a122ad7b41a2d652eccda5a6711b.jpg"},"summary":"在这个地球上，有很多外星来客已悄悄潜伏在人类的身边，他们或善良或邪恶，只是地球人从未察觉而已。在地处偏远的山形，擅长棒球的筒井雪隆（细谷佳正 配音）进入当地如月高中求学。当他打开公寓门的一刹那，却见到一个一头金色长发的男子。事后得知，此人是多古拉星第一王子马鹿•基•艾尔 •多古拉（浪川大辅 配音），因飞碟意外坠毁而失去记忆。面对这个经常装出一脸无辜却惹出麻烦不断的王子，雪隆真是伤透了脑筋。与此同时，对王子存有深深怨念的戈拉夫特（子安武人 配音）找到地球，他们不知不觉进入一个精心布好的谜局之中。当然，智商超高且品质极其恶劣的多古拉王子，他的地球之旅远未结束，原色战士Color Ranger、寻找一见钟情恋人的外星公主、逼婚新娘，不同星球的来客点缀着地球人的平凡生活……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-06-07 05:06:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepnqKXb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lejBkMYe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Yerpv5Bb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Xe0MmpVa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aMX2gPe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/penloXYb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/DdwxA5ge/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nel0mL7e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/kazAE55e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aKG2Bla/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/6dBv2p2d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/RdGA2xra/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/PdyzD5ze/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:46:11.039Z"}